usage: check_gradient_object_reports.py [-h] --build BUILD --review REVIEW
                                        --output OUTPUT

Bind the frozen public-gradient qualification to source and native bytes. This
reader preserves every original report hash and embeds the complete decoded
reports for the hosted artifact. It does not execute or emulate a Tensor
operation, change a fixed expectation, or count suites as API coverage.

options:
  -h, --help       show this help message and exit
  --build BUILD
  --review REVIEW
  --output OUTPUT
